                <mxCell id="note" value="REST list_sources is public. MCP requires a bearer token on every tool, including list_sources. There is no write tool and no open Cypher. &lt;br&gt;People records are not re-checked. Sales, Engineering, and Product trust the indexed ACL inside the freshness window." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Courier New;fontColor=#FFFFFF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
